This directory vendors tiny-brotli-dec-wasm 1.0.1, a streaming Brotli
decoder by Jorge Prendes, licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0.

  https://github.com/jprendes/tiny-brotli-dec-wasm

Only the WebAssembly decoder binary and the upstream license texts are
included. The fetch hook in tools/compressed-loader.js loads this wasm
so the game can ship a Brotli-compressed Godot engine on GitHub Pages,
which cannot set Content-Encoding headers.
